string         length()   codePoints  graphemes
------------------------------------------------
hello                 5            5          5
zażółć                6            6          6
🎯                    2            1          1
👨‍👩‍👧              8            5          1
café                 5            5          4

length()    counts UTF-16 code units  — storage
codePoints  counts Unicode characters — the table
graphemes   counts what a reader calls a character — the screen
